      "headers": [
        "Question",
        "Answer"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Are fungi plants?",
          "No — more closely related to animals than to plants"
        ],
        [
          "What is the cell wall made of?",
          "Chitin (same as insect exoskeleton; not cellulose like plants)"
        ],
        [
          "What is the \"Wood Wide Web\"?",
          "Mycorrhizal hyphal networks connecting forest trees; carbon/phosphorus exchange"
        ],
        [
          "How do fungi eat?",
          "Osmotrophic: secrete enzymes, absorb digested nutrients externally"
        ],
        [
          "Most dangerous human fungal pathogen?",
          "Cryptococcus neoformans (meningitis in immunocompromised); Candida auris (emerging drug-resistant)"
        ],
        [
          "Largest organism on Earth?",
          "Possibly Armillaria ostoyae in Oregon: 2,385 ha mycelial mat"
        ]
      ]
    }
